@startuml
title Adapter Pattern — chess-api.com HTTP service adapted to ChessApiInterface (returns JsonObject)

skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor #444444
  ArrowColor #444444
  FontColor #222222
  StereotypeFontColor #888888
}
hide circle

class AnalyzeMoveInteractor <<Client>> {
  - apiInterface : ChessApiInterface
  --
  + executeTurnAnalysis() : void
}

interface ChessApiInterface <<Target>> {
  + request(fen : String) : JsonObject
}

class ChessApiAdapter <<Adapter>> {
  - client : HttpClient
  --
  + request(fen : String) : JsonObject
  - ping(fen : String) : HttpResponse<String>
}

class HttpClient <<Adaptee>> {
  + send(req, handler) : HttpResponse<String>
}

AnalyzeMoveInteractor -right-> ChessApiInterface : uses
ChessApiAdapter .up.|> ChessApiInterface
ChessApiAdapter -left-> HttpClient : delegates

note bottom of ChessApiAdapter
  **request(fen)**
  return JsonParser
      .parseString( client.send(req).body() )
      .getAsJsonObject()
end note
@enduml
